# Exam track — Theme: Sproochen — Sub-lesson 2: Key Phrases
# Plain @sentence blocks (no @question) — shorter restatements of the same
# interview facts that sub-lesson 3 answers in full.
#
# These are the user's real answers, gathered by interview — do not "improve"
# or genericize them in a later editing pass.
#
# Handout corrections applied after LOD verification: Sauerrahm -> Sauerram,
# Nobier -> Noper, Liiblingswuert -> Liblingswuert.

